<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>

<Defs>

    <ThingDef Abstract="true" ParentName="ApparelMakeableBase" Name="CVN_BP_OnSkinBase">
    	<techLevel>Industrial</techLevel>
        <graphicData>
            <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
            <shaderType>CutoutComplex</shaderType>
            <drawSize>1.3</drawSize>
        </graphicData>
        <thingCategories>
            <li>CVN_BP_PactApparel</li>
        </thingCategories>
        <recipeMaker>
            <recipeUsers Inherit="false">
                <li>CVN_BP_FabricationBench</li>
            </recipeUsers>
        </recipeMaker>
		<uiIconScale>1.6</uiIconScale>
    </ThingDef>

    <ThingDef ParentName="CVN_BP_OnSkinBase">
        <defName>CVN_BP_Apparel_Fatigues</defName>
        <label>Sirdar fatigues</label>
        <recipeMaker>
		    <researchPrerequisites>
			 <li>CVN_BP_Basic</li>
			 <li>ComplexClothing</li>
			</researchPrerequisites>
            <skillRequirements>
                <Crafting>4</Crafting>
            </skillRequirements>
            <displayPriority>418</displayPriority>
        </recipeMaker>
        <graphicData>
            <texPath>Things/Pawn/Humanlike/Apparel/Sirdar/Onskin/BP_SirdarSkin</texPath>
        </graphicData>
		<stuffCategories>
            <li>Fabric</li>
        </stuffCategories>
	    <description>Standard Imperial Guard fatigues that have seen better times, now pressed into the service of the Blood Pact. These were likely kept after desertion or taken from a fallen soldier. \n\nThe battle-hardened Blood Pact were the core of the Chaos resistance forces in the Sabbat Worlds Crusade, fighting with a level of discipline unusual for Chaos cultists.</description>
        <costStuffCount>85</costStuffCount>
        <statBases>
            <MaxHitPoints>110</MaxHitPoints>
            <WorkToMake>4000</WorkToMake>
			<Mass>2</Mass>
            <StuffEffectMultiplierArmor>0.4</StuffEffectMultiplierArmor>
            <StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Cold>0.50</StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Cold>
            <StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Heat>0.25</StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Heat>
        </statBases>
        <apparel>
            <wornGraphicPath>Things/Pawn/Humanlike/Apparel/Sirdar/Onskin/BP_SirdarSkin</wornGraphicPath>
			<useWornGraphicMask>true</useWornGraphicMask>		
            <countsAsClothingForNudity>true</countsAsClothingForNudity>
            <bodyPartGroups>
                <li>Torso</li>
                <li>Legs</li>
                <li>Shoulders</li>
                <li>Arms</li>
				<li>Feet</li>
            </bodyPartGroups>
            <layers>
                <li>OnSkin</li>
            </layers>
            <tags>
                <li>CVN_BP_Apparelskin1</li>
            </tags>
        </apparel>
    </ThingDef>
	
	<ThingDef ParentName="CVN_BP_OnSkinBase">
        <defName>CVN_BP_Apparel_DBfatigues</defName>
        <label>Death tunic</label>
        <recipeMaker>
		    <researchPrerequisites>
			 <li>CVN_BP_Vanguard</li>
			 <li>ComplexClothing</li>
			</researchPrerequisites>
            <skillRequirements>
                <Crafting>4</Crafting>
            </skillRequirements>
            <displayPriority>419</displayPriority>
        </recipeMaker>
        <graphicData>
            <texPath>Things/Pawn/Humanlike/Apparel/DeathBrigade/Onskin/BP_DeathBOnskin</texPath>
        </graphicData>
		<stuffCategories>
		    <li>Leathery</li>
        </stuffCategories>
	    <description>Taking on a more ceremonial appearance, these tunic-like fatigues are worn by senior members of the Pact. The Death Brigade often serves at the vanguard of Blood Pact assaults and is the equivalent of Imperial Guard storm troopers. They are the most skilled and the most feared of all Blood Pact units.</description>
        <costStuffCount>125</costStuffCount>
        <statBases>
            <MaxHitPoints>125</MaxHitPoints>
            <WorkToMake>6500</WorkToMake>
			<Mass>2</Mass>
            <StuffEffectMultiplierArmor>0.5</StuffEffectMultiplierArmor>
            <StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Cold>0.55</StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Cold>
            <StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Heat>0.20</StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Heat>
        </statBases>
        <apparel>
            <wornGraphicPath>Things/Pawn/Humanlike/Apparel/DeathBrigade/Onskin/BP_DeathBOnskin</wornGraphicPath>
			<useWornGraphicMask>true</useWornGraphicMask>		
            <countsAsClothingForNudity>true</countsAsClothingForNudity>
            <bodyPartGroups>
                <li>Torso</li>
                <li>Legs</li>
                <li>Shoulders</li>
                <li>Arms</li>
				<li>Feet</li>
            </bodyPartGroups>
            <layers>
                <li>OnSkin</li>
            </layers>
            <tags>
                <li>CVN_BP_Apparelskin2</li>
            </tags>
        </apparel>
    </ThingDef>
	
    <ThingDef ParentName="CVN_BP_OnSkinBase">
        <defName>CVN_BP_Apparel_ArnogaurChainmail</defName>
        <label>Arnogaur chainmail</label>
        <recipeMaker>
		    <researchPrerequisites>
			 <li>CVN_BP_Elites</li>
			 <li>PlateArmor</li>
			</researchPrerequisites>
            <skillRequirements>
                <Crafting>5</Crafting>
            </skillRequirements>
            <displayPriority>420</displayPriority>
        </recipeMaker>
        <graphicData>
            <texPath>Things/Pawn/Humanlike/Apparel/Arnogaur/Onskin/BP_ArnogaurOnskin</texPath>
        </graphicData>
		<stuffCategories>
		    <li>Metallic</li>
        </stuffCategories>
	    <description>In contrast to the corrupted armour it lies beneath, this chainmail is unimpressive and simple.</description>
        <costStuffCount>125</costStuffCount>
        <statBases>
            <MaxHitPoints>150</MaxHitPoints>
            <WorkToMake>9500</WorkToMake>
			<Mass>5</Mass>
            <StuffEffectMultiplierArmor>0.4</StuffEffectMultiplierArmor>
            <StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Cold>0.40</StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Cold>
            <StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Heat>0.20</StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Heat>
        </statBases>
	    <equippedStatOffsets>
            <MoveSpeed>-0.10</MoveSpeed>
		</equippedStatOffsets>
        <apparel>
            <wornGraphicPath>Things/Pawn/Humanlike/Apparel/Arnogaur/Onskin/BP_ArnogaurOnskin</wornGraphicPath>
			<useWornGraphicMask>true</useWornGraphicMask>		
            <countsAsClothingForNudity>true</countsAsClothingForNudity>
            <bodyPartGroups>
                <li>Torso</li>
                <li>Legs</li>
                <li>Shoulders</li>
                <li>Arms</li>
            </bodyPartGroups>
            <layers>
                <li>OnSkin</li>
            </layers>
            <tags>
                <li>CVN_BP_Apparelskin3</li>
            </tags>
        </apparel>
    </ThingDef>
	
	<ThingDef ParentName="CVN_BP_OnSkinBase">
        <defName>CVN_BP_Apparel_Goremagerobe</defName>
        <label>Gore Mage tunic</label>
        <recipeMaker>
		    <researchPrerequisites>
			 <li>CVN_BP_Elites</li>
			 <li>ComplexClothing</li>
			</researchPrerequisites>
            <skillRequirements>
                <Crafting>4</Crafting>
            </skillRequirements>
            <displayPriority>418</displayPriority>
        </recipeMaker>
        <graphicData>
            <texPath>Things/Pawn/Humanlike/Apparel/Goremage/Onskin/BP_GoreMageOnskin</texPath>
        </graphicData>
		<stuffCategories>
		    <li>Leathery</li>
        </stuffCategories>
	    <description>The raiment of a Gore Mage, a Chaos Psyker of the Blood Pact. \n\nTattered Blood Pact fatigues sewn into a crude robe, it was once a standard Imperial uniform, but it is now adorned with wrappings of old cloth and blood-tanned leather, giving a distinct and gruesome appearance.</description>
        <costStuffCount>95</costStuffCount>
        <statBases>
            <MaxHitPoints>110</MaxHitPoints>
            <WorkToMake>5000</WorkToMake>
			<Mass>2</Mass>
            <StuffEffectMultiplierArmor>0.4</StuffEffectMultiplierArmor>
            <StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Cold>0.50</StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Cold>
            <StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Heat>0.25</StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Heat>
        </statBases>
        <equippedStatOffsets>
         <PsychicSensitivityOffset>0.05</PsychicSensitivityOffset>
         <PsychicEntropyRecoveryRate>0.011</PsychicEntropyRecoveryRate>
        </equippedStatOffsets>
        <apparel>
            <wornGraphicPath>Things/Pawn/Humanlike/Apparel/Goremage/Onskin/BP_GoreMageOnskin</wornGraphicPath>
			<useWornGraphicMask>true</useWornGraphicMask>		
            <countsAsClothingForNudity>true</countsAsClothingForNudity>
            <bodyPartGroups>
                <li>Torso</li>
                <li>Legs</li>
                <li>Shoulders</li>
                <li>Arms</li>
				<li>Feet</li>
            </bodyPartGroups>
            <layers>
                <li>OnSkin</li>
            </layers>
            <tags>
                <li>CVN_BP_mage</li>
            </tags>
        </apparel>
    </ThingDef>

</Defs>
